<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST. JOSEPH 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Top $56.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    55.50-56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>US 1-2 ship 221-228 lbs    55.00-55.50</p>
<p>Sows:  $0.50 to 1.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	500-550 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>		550-700 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
